                                yadi vā bhagaśabdaḥ samastaiśvaryamāhātmyādivacanaḥ

‘vighnabhūtā ityatrābhūtatadbhāve
                                    cvirna sambhavati, rogāṇāmutpattita eva
                                    vighnasvarūpatvenāvighnasvarūpatvābhāvāt’ iti gaṅgādharaḥ;

‘vinayenābhigamyainaṃ
                                    dra(pra)ṣṭukāmo mahāyaśāḥ; dṛṣṭvaiva ca muniṃ prāha bhāgavān
                                    pākaśāsanaḥ;; svāgataṃ ceti dharmajño munistasmādyathepsitam;
                                    arcitaśca yathānyāyamupaviṣṭaḥ samāgataḥ;; tatropāyaṃ vikārāṇāṃ
                                    papraccha harivāhanam; brūhi naḥ praśamopāyaṃ
                                    teṣāmamarasattama;; śrutveti vacanaṃ tasya sarvabhūtahitāvaham;
                                    tasmai provāca’ ityadhikaḥ pāṭha upalabhyate
                                    kvaciddhastalikhitapustake;

‘śabdākṣarapadanyāsacchandovṛttarasakramaiḥ; śrutvā
                                    sahasravarṣāṇāmārogyārthaṃ viniścayam;; tenāyuramitaṃ’
                                    ityadhikaḥ pāṭhaḥ kvacitpustake dṛśyate;

;
                                karma tūtpannaṃ karotyeva paraṃ saṃyogavibhāgau na tu
                                    kāraṇāntaraṃ

prakaraṇamupasaṃharati- itītyādi| iti samāptau;
                                tenaitāvadeva sāmānyādiṣaṭkaṃ sarvasyaiva kāryajātasya kāraṇaṃ,
                                nānyat kāraṇamasti|53|-

mahāsneheṣu sarpirādau paṭhitaṃ, prādhānyāt;
                                vacanaṃ hi- “nānyaḥ snehastathā kaścit saṃskāramanuvartate| yathā
                                sarpirataḥ sarpiḥ sarvasnehottamaṃ matam” (ni.a.1) iti||86-87||-

‘yadā nāryāvupeyātāṃ
                                    vṛṣasyantyau kathañcana; muñcantyau śukramanyonyamanasthistatra
                                    jāyate’ iti suśrute (śā.a.2) pāṭhaḥ;

)| uśanti kathayanti|
                                vidārī vidārīkandaḥ| sitopalā sitaśarkarā| madhuśeṣaḥ sikthakam|
                                siddhamiti ghṛtadugdhayuktaṃ sat kiñcidevāgnau sādhitam||18-22||-

ṣaḍ virecanaśatāni, iti yaduktaṃ tadiha
                                saṅgraheṇodāhṛtya vistareṇa kalpopaniṣadi vyākhyāsyāmaḥ;
                                    (tatra

‘mudgamāṣaparṇyau’ iti pā.;
                                    ‘parṇīśabdo mudgamāṣābhyāṃ yojyaḥ, tena mudgaparṇī māṣaparṇī ca’
                                    iti gaṅgādharaḥ;

‘kāmyaṃ puṣṭibalapradam;
                                    saumanasyamalakṣmīghnaṃ snānamojaskaraṃ param’;; iti
                                pā.;

‘gaṅgādharastu
                                    ‘okasātmyaṃ’ iti paṭhati, ‘okādaucityāt
                                    sātmyamityokasātmyamityucyate’ iti ca vyākhyānayati;

‘mūtrajeṣu tu pāne ca prāgbhaktaṃ śasyate ghṛtam; jīrṇāntikaṃ
                                    cottamayā mātrayā yojanādvayam;; avapīḍakametacca sañjñitaṃ’
                                    vāgbhaṭaḥ (sū.a.4);

asyāgre- “alakṣmīdoṣayuktatvānnaktaṃ tu
                                    dadhi varjitam; śleṣmalaṃ syāt sasarpiṣkaṃ dadhi mārutasūdanam;;
                                    na ca sandhukṣayet pittamāhāraṃ ca vipācayet; śarkarāsaṃyutaṃ
                                    dadyāttṛṣṇādāhanivāraṇam;; mudgasūpena saṃyuktaṃ
                                    dadyādraktānilāpaham; surasaṃ cālpadoṣaṃ ca kṣaudrayuktaṃ
                                    bhaveddadhi; uṣṇaṃ pittāsrakṛddoṣān dhātrīyuktaṃ tu nirharet”;;
                                    iti kvacidadhikaḥ pāṭha upalabhyate;

‘śubhāśubhapravṛttinivṛttihetuśca dravyāśritaṃ
                                    karma yaducyate sā kriyeti’ iti yogīndranāthasenasammataḥ
                                    pāṭhaḥ;

yogīndranāthasenastu ‘sumanaḥsugandhiḥ
                                    syāt’ iti paṭhati, ‘sumanobhiḥ puṣpaiḥ puṣpasrajetyarthaḥ,
                                    sugandhiḥ syāt’ iti ca vyākhyānayati;

‘jyotīṃṣyaniṣṭamaśastaṃ ca’
                                    iti pā.; jyotīṃṣyagniṃ cāmedhyaśastaṃ ca iti gaṅgādharasammataḥ
                                    pāṭhaḥ;

‘mūrdhani śirasi sthitāni khāni sapta
                                    āsyaṃ, nāsāpuṭe, cakṣuṣī, śrotre ca’ iti
                                    yogīndranāthasenaḥ;

yataśca pratikurvan sidhyati, pratikurvan mriyate;
                                apratikurvan sidhyati, apratikurvan mriyate; tataścintyate
                                    bheṣajamabheṣajenāviśiṣṭamiti

|
                                mūlaviparyayeṇeti kāraṇaviparyayeṇa, tacca prabhāvāditi boddhavyaṃ;
                                tena viṣavikārasya viṣeṇopacaraṇametat pratyakṣaṃ cānyadupagṛhītaṃ
                                bhavati| kāntatamo vikārapraśamakatvenābhīṣṭatamaḥ;
                                anye+arthadharmopāyāḥ kāntāḥ kāntatarāśca, ayaṃ tu bheṣajasamudāyaḥ
                                sarvocchedakarogaharatvena kāntatamaḥ||6||

‘āptaḥ khalu
                                    sākṣātkṛtadharmā yathādṛṣṭasyārthasya cikhyāpayiṣayā prayukta
                                    upadeṣṭā; sākṣātkaraṇamarthasyāptiḥ, tayā pravartata ityāptaḥ;
                                    ṛṣyāryamlecchānāṃ samānaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ, tathā ca sarveṣāṃ vyavahārāḥ
                                    pravartante’ iti nyāyadarśanabhāṣye vātsyāyanaḥ;

‘nābhyāṃ
                                    kāryakāraṇatābhāvau sādhyete, kiṃ tarhi vyavahāraḥ’ iti
                                    mudritatattvasaṅgrahapustake pāṭhaḥ;

ata evānumīyate- yat- svakṛtamaparihāryamavināśi
                                paurvadehikaṃ daivasañjñakamānubandhikaṃ karma, tasyaitat phalam;
                                itaścānyadbhaviṣyatīti; phaladbījamanumīyate, phalaṃ ca bījāt

ityasātmyendriyārthasaṃyogaḥ, prajñāparādhaḥ,
                                pariṇāmaśceti trayastrividhavikalpā hetavo vikārāṇāṃ;
                                samayogayuktāstu prakṛtihetavo bhavanti

‘udīrṇāṃśca na
                                    dhārayedityatra cakārādanudīrṇāṃśca nodīrayedityartho jñeyaḥ’
                                    iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘stambhasya gauravaṃ bahutvamatistabdhatetyarthaḥ; na tu
                                    gauravamityarthaḥ, alāghave iti pūrvamuktatvāt’ iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘uttaraḥ pradhāno vāto
                                    yatra īdṛśo yo vātakaphasaṃsargastatra hitāni’ iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘yadvācyamuktamiti svedādhyāye yadvācyaṃ yo+artha uktaḥ,
                                    tacchiṣyaiḥ; pratipattavyaṃ, yataḥ punarvasurupadeṣṭā’ iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘saha
                                    upāśrayeṇa vartamānāni sopāśrayāṇi, upāśraya upadhānabhedaḥ’ iti
                                    yogīndranāthasenaḥ; ‘svāpāśrayāṇi’ iti pā.;

'siddhisamānasaṃśrayeṇa' iti pā.;
                                    'siddhisaṃśrayaṃ bheṣajakṣapita ityādinoktaṃ' iti
                                    yogīndranāthasenaḥ;

'mahattvaṃ cāsya
                                    pūrvādhyāyāpekṣayā, na tu mahāyāsasādhyānāṃ
                                    rogāṇāmabhidhāyako+adhyāyo mahārogādhyāyaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

upadekṣyate;
                                tadyathā- bastiḥ purīṣādhānaṃ kaṭiḥ sakthinī pādāvasthīni
                                pakvāśayaśca vātasthānāni, tatrāpi pakvāśayo viśeṣeṇa vātasthānaṃ;
                                svedo raso lasīkā rudhiramāmāśayaśca pittasthānāni, tatrāpyāmāśayo
                                viśeṣeṇa pittasthānam; uraḥ śiro grīvā parvāṇyāmāśayo medaśca
                                śleṣmasthānāni, tatrāpyuro viśeṣeṇa śleṣmasthānam

'eṣāṃ ca ninditatve vairūpyameva hetuḥ;
                                    pratyekaṃ cakārakaraṇameṣāṃ
                                    parasparasāṅkarye+atiśayitanindyatvaṃ bodhayati, tena
                                    atidīrgho+atihrasvo vā puruṣo yadyatilomādirbhavati, tadā
                                    viśeṣānnindito bhavatītyarthaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'yadyapi tamobhavā+api
                                    vyādhireva, tathā+api sā mānasadoṣajanyeti na tasyāḥ
                                    śārīravyādhiṣvantarbhāva ityarthaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'pūrvādhyāye tarpaṇairbṛṃhaṇairityuktam,
                                    atastadabhidhāyakaṃ laṅghanabṛṃhaṇīyamāha- athāta ityādi' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

'laṅghanamityādi; rūkṣādīnyapi
                                    laṅghanabṛṃhaṇayorantarbhavanti, yaduktaṃ “snehanaṃ rūkṣaṇaṃ
                                    karma svedanaṃ stambhanaṃ ca yat; bhūtānāṃ tacca
                                    dvaividhyāddvitayaṃ nātivartate iti” (vā. sū. 14);
                                    tathā+apyaśeṣaviśeṣajñānārthaṃ teṣāmapīha bhedenopādānaṃ
                                    mantavyam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'santarpaṇasya dvaividhyamāha- yattadātva ityādi;
                                    tadātve iti sadyaḥ, samarthamiti
                                    apatarpaṇajavyādhinirākaraṇasamarthaṃ; tena sadyaḥ
                                    santarpaṇamekam, abhyāsavaśāt santarpaṇamaparamityarthaḥ' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

'iyamapyarthaparā sañjñā; kiṃvā vidhinā
                                    śoṇitamitiśabdamadhikṛtya kṛto+adhyāyo vidhiśoṇitīyādhyāyaḥ;
                                    “varṇāgamaḥ” ityādinā 'nā' śabdalopaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'yadyapi śoṇitavikārā api vātādijanyā eva, tathā+api dhātuṣu
                                    bahuvikārakartṛtvena prādhānyasūcanārthaṃ
                                    pṛthagadhyāye+abhidhānaṃ jñeyam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'saktānalpadrutābhāṣamiti saktaṃ vicchinnavarṇam, analpaṃ bahu,
                                    drutaṃ śīghraṃ bhāṣate yaḥ sa tathā, evaṃ paruṣābhāsamityapi
                                    vyākhyeyam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'atīndriyamiti hetugarbhaviśeṣaṇam,
                                    atīndriyaṃ sūkṣmaṃ niravayavamiti yāvat, yasmādatīndriya ātmā
                                    mano+apyatīndriyaṃ tasmānna rasajam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'tejo+antānāmiti bhūjalānilatejasāṃ kramāt kharadravacaloṣṇatvaṃ
                                    yathā svabhāvasiddhaṃ, tathā vyādhipuruṣayorapi
                                    svabhāvasiddhatetyarthaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'svargādiphalasyāpi
                                    svabhāvādeva jāyamānatvena yāgādīnāṃ niṣprayojanatvāt' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

'mātrādīn
                                    sarvānudāharantu' iti gaṅgādharasammataḥ pāṭhaḥ; 'mātrādīn
                                    sarvānanudāharantaḥ' iti yogīndranāthasenasammataḥ pāṭhaḥ;
                                    'mātrādīn bhāvānanudāharanta iti
                                    gurulaghutvādiguṇavadaparigaṇayantaḥ, atra hetumāha-
                                    teṣāmityādi' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'kālānatikrameṇa kāryakaraṇaṃ sampratipattiḥ, avyavasāyaḥ
                                    anudyogaḥ, 'adhyavasāya' iti pāṭhe adhyavasāyaḥ
                                    kartavyatāmātreṇa jñānam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'atra jvarādīnāmapi pīḍākaratvādi
                                    jñātvā bhiṣagāturaśca tatpraśame+avahito bhaghatīti
                                    jvarādijñānamapi vighātāya samarthaṃ bhavati' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'rasāhāraviniścaya iti
                                    rasaviniścayapūrvaka āhāraviniścayo rasāhāraviniścayaḥ' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘etaddhi lāghavaṃ svābhāvikameva, na tu rasavaśaṃ’, tathā sati
                                    kaṣāyamadhuratvādgurutvaṃ syāt, vakṣyate ca-
                                    ‘svādurgurutvādadhikaḥ kaṣāyāllavaṇo+avaraḥ’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'eka eva rasa ityādi yaduktaṃ tannirākaroti-
                                    teṣāmityādi; ṣaṇṇāṃ rasānāmityanena rasasyaikatvāvadhāraṇaṃ
                                    pratyuktaṃ, rasabhedasya pratyakṣasiddhatvāditi bhāvaḥ;
                                    yonirādhārakāraṇam, etena 'sa punarudakānanyaḥ' iti
                                    pratyākhyātaṃ, kāryakāraṇayorbhedasya durupapannatvāditi bhāvaḥ;
                                    chedanopaśamane karmaṇī, tayormiśrībhāvācca
                                    sādhāraṇatvamityanena dvitīyatṛtīyapakṣau nirākṛtau;
                                    bhaktiricchārthaḥ, tena yo yamicchati sa tasya svāduritaraḥ
                                    punarasvāduriti puruṣāpekṣau dharmau, na
                                    rasabhedakāriṇāvityarthaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

;
                                taccetanāvadacetanaṃ ca, tasya guṇāḥ śabdādayo gurvādayaśca
                                dravāntāḥ, karma pañcavidhamuktaṃ vamanādi

,
                                tānyupacayasaṅghātagauravasthairyakarāṇi;
                                dravasnigdhaśītamandamṛdupicchilarasaguṇabahulānyāpyāni,
                                tānyupakledasnehabandhaviṣyandamārdavaprahlādakarāṇi;
                                uṣṇatīkṣṇasūkṣmalaghurūkṣaviśadarūpaguṇabahulānyāgneyāni, tāni
                                dāhapākaprabhāprakāśavarṇakarāṇi;
                                laghuśītarūkṣakharaviśadasūkṣmasparśaguṇabahulāni vāyavyāni, tāni
                                raukṣyaglānivicāravaiśadyalāghavakarāṇi;
                                mṛdulaghusūkṣmaślakṣṇaśabdaguṇabahulānyākāśātmakāni, tāni
                                mārdavasauṣiryalāghavakarāṇi

'pṛthaktvaṃ lakṣayati- pṛthaktvaṃ
                                    syādityādi; idamasmāt pṛthaganyadarthāntaramityādivyavahāro yato
                                    bhavati, tat pṛthakatvaṃ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'guṇā guṇāśrayā noktā' iti
                                    saguṇatve dravyatvaprasaṅgāditi bhāvaḥ, tasmādrasanirdiṣṭān
                                    guṇān dravyaguṇāneva vidyāt, ekārthasamavāyenopacārāditi bhāvaḥ'
                                    iti śivadāsasenaḥ; gurvādayo guṇā dravye pṛthivyādau rasāśraye;
                                    raseṣu vyapadiśyante sāhacaryopacārataḥ' (vā. sū. 9) iti
                                    vāgbhaṭaḥ;

'nanu kāraṇānāṃ
                                    bhūtānāṃ pañcavidhatvena kāryasyāpi rasasya pañcavidhatvameva
                                    yuktamityabhipretya ṣaṭtvamupapādayati- somaguṇātirekādityādi;
                                    somo jaladevatā, tena jalaguṇātirekādityarthaḥ; kiṃvā
                                    somaśabdena pṛthivījalayoreva grahaṇam, ubhayorapi saumyatvāt;
                                    ata eva suśrute+api 'pṛthivyambuguṇabāhulyānmadhura' ityādi;
                                    tathā tatraiva 'pṛthivyagniguṇabāhulyāllavaṇaḥ,
                                    toyāgniguṇabāhulyādamla' iti yaduktaṃ tadapi na virudhyate,
                                    bhūmijalayoḥ saumyatvenaikarūpatayā kāryavirodhābhāvāt' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

vāyorūrdhvajvalanatvācca vahneḥ; salilapṛthivyātmakāstu
                                prāyeṇādhobhājaḥ, pṛthivyā gurutvānnimnagatvāccodakasya;
                                vyāmiśrātmakāḥ punarubhayatobhājaḥ

'samprati viruddhavīryatvena
                                    viruddhavipākatvena vā rasadvāreṇa yeṣā guṇā na nirdeśyāstānāha-
                                    madhuramityādi' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'lavaṇamityādi; lavaṇamapi na
                                    kiñciduṣṇaṃ yathā saindhavam, amlamapi na kiñciduṣṇaṃ
                                    yathā+a+amalakam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'pippalītyādi; atra pippalīnāgarayoḥ
                                    kaṭukayorapi tadviparītamadhuravipākitvena noṣṇatvaṃ jñeyam' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

'tasmādityādi; uktarītyā
                                    tulyarase+api dravye yato guṇāntaraṃ dṛṣṭaṃ, tasmādityarthaḥ'
                                    iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'tadvaccitrakatulyarasavīryavipākā; etena citrakasya
                                    rasādyaistulyāyāmapi dantyāṃ yadvirekatvarūpaṃ viśiṣṭakarma, tat
                                    svakāraṇaṃ prabhāvamanumāyatīti bhāvaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'śakunā+a+ahṛtaḥ uttarakurubhyo haṃsairānītaḥ,
                                    avantyāṃ vakranāmnā prasiddhaḥ, magadhadeśe tu pāśaka iti;
                                    vṛddhavaidyāstu- “dvīpāntarāt samānīto garuḍena mahātmanā;
                                    śakunā+a+ahṛtaḥ sa śāliḥ syādgaruḍāparanāmakaḥ” ityāhuḥ' iti
                                    suśrutaṭīkāyāṃ ḍallaṇaḥ; aruṇadattastu aṣṭāṅgahṛdayaṭīkāyāṃ
                                    “śakunāhṛto yo magadheṣu buddhotpādakāle uttarakurubhyo
                                    haṃsairānīto mṛgārimātrā viśākhākhyayā vāpito vistāraṃ gataḥ,
                                    ata eva śakunāhṛta ityanvarthā+asya sañjñā” ityāha;

'kiṃvā, suśrute yavo laghuḥ paṭhitaḥ; tena,
                                    atrāpyakārapraśleṣeṇa 'aguruḥ' iti pāṭho mantavyaḥ;
                                    gurutvapratijñānārthamīṣadarthe nañ praśleṣayanti, ata eva
                                    laghurityasandigdhamapi na paṭhitam; anye tu guruguṇasyāpi
                                    yavasya kaṭuvipākitvaṃ dravyaprabhāvādeva samarthanīyamityāhuḥ;
                                    sakaṣāya īṣatkaṣāyaḥ; balyatvaṃ ca srotoviśuddhikaratvena
                                    samyagrasasañcāreṇeṣṭaṃ, na tu dehasyopacayakārakatvena
                                    raukṣyādidharmayogādyavasya' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

'sakaṣāyaśceti kaṣāyasya
                                    svādutvāpekṣayā hīnatā+avabodhārthamupasarjanārthaṃ sahaśabdaḥ
                                    prayukta iti jñeyam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

parūṣakamiha pakvam, āmasya pittajanakatvāt;
                                    uktaṃ ca vāgbhaṭe- “vātaghnaṃ pittajananamāmaṃ vidyāt parūṣakam;
                                    tadeva pakvaṃ madhuraṃ vātapittanibarhaṇam” iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘sugandhi
                                    madhuraṃ sāmlaṃ viśadaṃ bhaktarocanam; guru vātapraśamanaṃ
                                    vidyānnāriṅgajaṃ phalam’ iti pā.;

‘nanu ekavidhatve kiñcijjalaṃ sadoṣaṃ
                                    kiñcicca saguṇamiti yo bheda upalabhyate tasya kā gatirityāha-
                                    tat patadityādi’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘payaḥkṣīrasañjñāsāmānyāt payasa iva jīvanīyādiguṇayogācca
                                    toyavargānantaraṃ kṣīravargaḥ prastūyate; tatra śreṣṭhatvāt
                                    prathamaṃ gavyakṣīraguṇamāha- svādvityādi’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

‘ekaḥ śaphaḥ khuro yāsāṃ tā ekaśaphāḥ; atrāśvāyā
